This paper investigates the Kirchhoff type elliptic system given by
  \begin{align}
  \begin{cases}
  \displaystyle \frac{1}{2}\left(\tau|u|^{2\tau}+1\right)\Delta_{\mathbb{B}^{N+1}_1\,}u &= \left(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\overline{K}_i|v_i|^{2\sigma_i-2}v_i\right|_{\mathbb{B}^{N+1}_1},\\
  \displaystyle \frac{1}{2}\left(\tau|v_i|^{2\tau}+1\right)\Delta_{\mathbb{B}^{N+1}_1\,}v_i &= \left(\sum_{j=1}^{N}\overline{K}_j|u|^{2\sigma_j-2}u\right|_{\mathbb{B}^{N+1}_1},
  \end{cases}
  \end{align}
  where $\mathbb{B}^{N+1}_1$ denotes the unit ball in $\mathbb{R}^{N+1}$, for $2\leq\tau<4$ and $1<\sigma_i<\frac{4}{\tau}$, $i=1,2,\dots,N$.

